{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore vast open world map!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover diverse biomes with unique resources, hidden secrets, and dangerous foes. Every corner holds a new adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276570/extras/v3_noboarder_optimized.png?t=1746942275\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather materials, hunt for food, and manage your health and stamina to stay alive in a hostile environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276570/extras/Untitled-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1746942275\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Gather, Hunt, and Thrive! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the island and hunt for survival. Use your skills to track and take down monsters, gather resources, craft tools, and cook meals to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276570/extras/ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1746942275\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Be aware of where you are </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch out for island monsters roaming the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276570/extras/1GifOne-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1746942275\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Defend. Survive. Endure the Island.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276570/extras/InvasionFightGif-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1746942275\" /></p>","backg